# 30-60-90 Day Digital Health Transformation Plan

## First 30 Days – Understand
- Engage clinical, IT, and leadership stakeholders
- Assess digital maturity
- Identify quick wins and bottlenecks

## Next 60 Days – Design
- Define priority initiatives
- Establish standards and playbooks
- Pilot targeted digital interventions

## Next 90 Days – Scale
- Expand successful pilots
- Strengthen governance and metrics
- Drive adoption and continuous improvement
